@Backend_HostAddress = https://localhost:7216

### Salud del proceso (no valida conexión ERP)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Catálogo ficticio (solo Development)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/v1/inventory/products
Accept: application/json

### Documento OpenAPI (solo Development; no es Swagger UI)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Preflight del frontend oficial local
OPTIONS {{Backend_HostAddress}}/v1/inventory/products
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type,authorization

### Error estructurado 404
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/ruta-inexistente
Accept: application/json

### Ejemplo original conservado
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json
